<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 08.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 08.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct to Tilbury Jul 125.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to West Norfolk Jun 84/83.50 Jan/Mar 89.00 Apr/Jun 92.00</p>
<p>Yorlshire first half Aug 86.00</p>
<p>Avon Jul 84.00/83.50/83.00 first half Aug 85.00/84.00 Sep 81.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire first half Aug 88.50/87.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Southampton asa 77.50/77.00/76.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk asa 77.00 Jan/Mar 86.50</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 83.50 Jan/Mar 86.50</p>
</text>
